    "description": "POST /webhook/ar/twilio/voice, called by Twilio Programmable Voice on an inbound call. Answers TwiML: Dial Sip to the OpenAI Realtime SIP ingress with a synthetic in-car UUI, referUrl on AR-53, action on AR-54. Without openaiProjectId in ar_proof_config the caller hears a lab line (Twilio-only smoke test). POST /webhook/ar/proof/config (gateway auth) upserts the config rows."
